#: ../../../reference/dsl-api.md:0
msgid ""
"Declared shape facts, verified by the generated launcher before the kernel "
"runs and assumed by the compiler when discharging safety checks. Two forms: "
"`dim(a, i) == dim(b, j)` (two axis extents are equal) and `dim(t, k) % d == "
"0` (an axis extent is a multiple of the integer literal `d`). A launch whose "
"shapes violate a declared fact is rejected with an error naming it"
msgstr ""

